237	- If CI fails, send the failing output to the responsible worker and ask them to fix and push.
238	- If review changes are requested, send the review findings to the responsible worker.
239	- If work is green and approved, report that state to the human. Do not merge unless explicitly asked and supported by project rules.
240	
241	%s`, projectName(project), project.ID, project.ID, project.ID, projectContextSection(project))
