191	// PreLaunch is an optional capability the spawn engine invokes (via type
192	// assertion) immediately before creating the session. Claude Code shows a
193	// blocking "do you trust this folder?" dialog the first time it runs in any
194	// directory. Every AO worktree is a fresh path, so without this the
195	// agent would hang at that prompt with no one to answer it.
196	//
