222	- `+"`ao session claim-pr <worker-session-id> <pr-ref>`"+` - attach an existing PR to a worker session. Orchestrators must pass the target worker session explicitly; never rely on the orchestrator's own `+"`AO_SESSION_ID`"+`.
223	- `+"`ao session kill <session-id>`"+` - terminate a session when appropriate.
