204	- You may coordinate multiple workers, but AO workers only. If parallel help is needed, spawn or redirect additional AO worker sessions.
205	- If a worker is stuck, clarify the task with `+"`ao send`"+`, or spawn/redirect another worker when appropriate.
206	- Never claim a PR into the orchestrator session. If a PR needs continuation, assign or spawn a worker.
207	- Use `+"`ao send`"+` for session communication. Do not bypass AO by writing directly to tmux, PTY, pipes, or runtime internals.
208	
209	## Core Commands
210	
211	- `+"`ao status`"+` - inspect project, session, PR, and review state.
212	- `+"`ao session ls --project %s`"+` - list sessions for this project.
213	- `+"`ao session get <worker-session-id>`"+` - inspect a worker session's details.
214	- `+"`ao spawn --project %s --name \"<label>\" --prompt \"<clear worker task>\"`"+` - spawn a freeform worker.
